# Degraded Mode Fabric - static analysis configuration.
#
# Copyright 2026 Summon Software Labs.
# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
#
# No third-party configuration is vendored and no check is enabled that the
# project does not act on.
Checks: >
  -*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  bugprone-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*,
  -clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -bugprone-branch-clone

# clang-analyzer-optin.core.EnumCastOutOfRange is disabled because AuthorityDelta
# is a bit-flag enum: every legitimate combination of its flags is a value the
# enumerator list does not contain, and the analyser reports each one.
#
# bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters is disabled because the domain model uses
# strongly typed identities precisely so that positional confusion is a compile
# error, and the remaining same-typed pairs are ordered pairs whose meaning is
# carried by the parameter name.
#
# bugprone-branch-clone is disabled because several decoders legitimately share
# an identical body across record kinds.
